[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10926.71, "timestamp": "03:02:06", "text": "等等，地毯都铺好了吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10929.75, "timestamp": "03:02:09", "text": "好了，地毯都到齐了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10933.99, "timestamp": "03:02:13", "text": "我呃，积木。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10938.79, "timestamp": "03:02:18", "text": "你全都给了吗？是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10941.429, "timestamp": "03:02:21", "text": "我不需要它。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10943.67, "timestamp": "03:02:23", "text": "谢谢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10947.349, "timestamp": "03:02:27", "text": "呃，我们应该用木头代替吗？ H."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10949.67, "timestamp": "03:02:29", "text": "所以，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10954.469, "timestamp": "03:02:34", "text": "谁也不会知道。我们重做了一遍。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10961.269, "timestamp": "03:02:41", "text": "好的。我们甚至连手工制作都没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10963.67, "timestamp": "03:02:43", "text": "表格在这里。他们为什么要制作这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10967.67, "timestamp": "03:02:47", "text": "没用的客房？不，手工制作已经结束了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10969.51, "timestamp": "03:02:49", "text": "这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10976.55, "timestamp": "03:02:56", "text": "施工现场。"}]